  "reflectionText": "Nahum said: the Lord has his way in the whirlwind and in the storm, and the clouds are the dust of his feet. The Lord is good, a stronghold in the day of trouble. He knows those who take refuge in him. What is it to discover that the One whose feet stir the dust of the storm also knows your name when you take refuge in him?"
}
